{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55663","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十一 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"散诞疎狂得自然，免教拘迫事相牵。\n潜龙不离滔滔水，孤鹤唯宜远远天。\n透室寒光松槛月，逼人凉气石渠泉。\n非吾独了西来意，竹祖桐孙尽入玄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}